00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.784
Neither here nor there, stuck in a rut

00:00:24.784 --> 00:00:29.050
My niche feelings are all scattered around

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:32.584
Total obsession, my little cosmos

00:00:32.584 --> 00:00:35.999
Now transmitting, a CHU for you

00:00:35.999 --> 00:00:40.223
Wandering around, oh my dear lord

00:00:40.223 --> 00:00:43.879
ｍosi-mosi? Can you hear me?

