00:00:46.428 --> 00:00:50.250
Head over heels, transmitting through space

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.094
Hop-step-jump for a thousand meters

00:00:53.094 --> 00:00:56.609
Even if cats hate me, even if Mom scolds me

00:00:56.609 --> 00:01:00.547
I'll meet you, the one who's just right for me

00:01:00.547 --> 00:01:12.082
✽.｡.: Sorry, she's on the phone right now... *･ﾟ

