CQCQ, where are you, alien?

00:01:15.259 --> 00:01:17.102
Sob-sob, such a lonely area

00:01:17.102 --> 00:01:18.640
Wo ai ni, Hello, How are you?

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.294
Love and Peace, we're on the same wavelength

00:01:20.294 --> 00:01:21.888
How many light-years from my house to there?

00:01:21.888 --> 00:01:23.699
Or is it just next door in the 3rd Block?

00:01:23.699 --> 00:01:24.965
Where did my abducted heart go?

00:01:24.965 --> 00:01:26.504
In a ***QLO down jacket, is space cold?

00:01:26.504 --> 00:01:29.617
But still, I can't find you anywhere

00:01:29.617 --> 00:01:33.056
My gray feelings are hanging in mid-air

00:01:33.056 --> 00:01:35.641
I'm gonna find you, UFO!

00:01:35.641 --> 00:01:40.320
And tell you how much I've wanted to see you

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:43.146
Signals, signals... ah, out of service

00:01:43.146 --> 00:01:46.748
Still, head over heels, transmitting away

00:01:46.748 --> 00:01:49.782
Something's weird, Mr. Invader

00:01:49.782 --> 00:01:53.787
This love I pour only into you

00:01:53.787 --> 00:01:56.427
Signals, signals, mysterious signals

00:01:56.427 --> 00:02:00.190
Head over heels, transmitting through space

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:03.116
Something's weird, Mr. Invader

00:02:03.116 --> 00:02:07.113
This love I dedicate only to you, Ah

