Signals, signals, red signals

00:02:09.842 --> 00:02:13.693
Wrapped in a ribbon, now sending it out

00:02:13.693 --> 00:02:16.492
Signals, signals, can you hear me?

00:02:16.492 --> 00:02:18.394
Even if my heart is snatched away

00:02:18.394 --> 00:02:20.068
Right now, I will meet you

00:02:20.068 --> 00:02:21.831
The one for me

00:02:21.831 --> 00:02:25.384
My one and only

00:02:25.384 --> 00:02:28.654
4season

